.TH IMCURVIN 1 "August 2026" "1.3.0" "imcurvin manual"
.SH NAME
imcurvin \- Advanced multi-vector vulnerability exploitation and perimeter reconnaissance framework
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B imcurvin
[\fB\-h\fR] [\fB\-tech\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B imcurvin
is an open-source web security auditing and MySQL time-based injection framework. It features advanced WAF evasion, multi-port TOR routing, and dynamic network obfuscation matrix to safely analyze perimeter defenses.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h
Display the basic options list and help menu.
.TP
.B \-tech
View the technical architecture deep-dive and display critical legal safety disclaimers before framework deployment.
